# A level-1 user: the entries above the level are dimmed, and choosing
# one says why.  After logging out, F3 on the user name leaves the
# program as Esc does, so the snapshot after it is never taken.
T READER
K ENTER
T Reader1986
K ENTER
S HOME
K ALT-I
S MITEMS
T N
S DENIED
K ALT-L
S MLOCS
K ESC ALT-O
T L
K F3
S STAYED
